    "Reason : 1 - Due to its excessive size the outbuilding would fail to relate subordinately to the main dwelling and would appear as an overly dominant addition resulting in harm to the character and appearance of the local area contrary to Local Plan policies CC1, CC2 and SC7 as well as the council's design guidance.",
